{
	"$comment": "What the contract refuses in a message from the app, field by field (#614; PLAN.md, One validation rule for all platforms). Each SDK's generated check (hostMessageProblems, internal to the SDK) must give exactly `problems` for `message`: the field, dotted; the rule (format, length, count, range or value); and whether the page drops the field alone (isPatch, for appearance and text) or refuses the whole message. The cases pin where regex engines and string lengths differ. `decodes: false`: the generated decoders refuse the message. `refine`: fields the page refuses by a .refine, left to the page.",
	"cases": [
